                    <div class="font-mono text-xs bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 rounded-lg p-2 mb-2 border border-violet-200 dark:border-violet-700">
                        <div class="text-slate-500">Entrada: T(a=1, c=2, b=3)</div>
                        <div class="text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 font-semibold">μ_teórico = (a+c+b)/3 = 2.000</div>
                        <div class="text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300 font-semibold">σ²_teórico = (a²+c²+b²−ac−ab−cb)/18 = 0.167</div>
